  <!--EN: These cold-blooded lizard-like people have lived here for centuries, and instead of embracing technological progress, they chose industrial reliability. They are not afraid to utilise their military might to bring peace and order in the surrounding lands.\n\nOriginally engineered to survive on not-fully-terraformed planets with no humidity what-so-ever, saurids are a closely knit community that prefers to treat outsiders with aggression and show of force.-->
  <VRESaurids_OutlanderRoughSaurid.description>这些冷血的蜥蜴人已经在这里生活了几个世纪，他们没有拥抱技术进步，而是选择了工业可靠性。他们并不害怕利用自己的军事力量为周围的土地带来和平与秩序。

最初是为了在没有湿度的未完全改造的行星上生存而设计的，蜥蜴是一个紧密结合的群体，更喜欢以侵略和武力的方式对待外来者。</VRESaurids_OutlanderRoughSaurid.description>
